SIFT image describer ("SIFT", SIFT_Image_describer).

Keypoints and descriptors are computed by LeanSift
(https://github.com/rhiestan/LeanSIFT, vendored in third_party/LeanSIFT), a fast
SIMD and multi-threaded SIFT that reproduces VLFeat's vl_sift. It replaces the
VLFeat SIFT code (http://www.vlfeat.org/) that used to live in vl/.
